Description: Meson-based TypeScript CLI project template with example app
 zephyr is a template repository for small TypeScript command-line utilities.
 It currently ships the some_puff1 example application, npm/pnpm packaging metadata,
 and Debian packaging via Meson, with Node-based unit-test integration.
 Man and info pages are generated with Asciidoctor. Runtime gettext support uses
 node-gettext and gettext-parser (bundled under /usr/share/zephyr/node_modules).
